tle=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" href=\"?note=fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction\">14-thm-sheafification-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\)</span> (sheafification adjunction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" href=\"?note=fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction\">14-thm-sheafification-adjunction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsColimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\)</span> (colimit-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>固定小站点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为小指标范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsColimit}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\bigl(a(Q),(a(\\kappa_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsColimit}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\bigl(a(Q),(a(\\kappa_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Theorem 1、III.6 余极限公式 (6)，印刷页 128、135；DjVu 第 70、73 图页。一般左伴随保余极限见印刷页 22；DjVu 第 17 图页。</p>\n<p>对任意层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，伴随将从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aQ\">\\(aQ\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的箭头与从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"iG\">\\(iG\\)</span> 的箭头对应；余极限普遍性质再把它对应到各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aD(k)\\to G\">\\(aD(k)\\to G\\)</span> 的相容余锥。唯一性在各步保留，故像余锥为余极限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-identity-comp