d":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$ (functor predicate, see [[14-df-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}$ (object-set operation, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsColimit}$ (colimit-cone predicate, see [[14-df-limits-colimits]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsColimit}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsColimit}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsColimit}\\bigl(a(Q),(a(\\kappa_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"aQ","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"iG","display":false},{"tex":"aD(k)\\to G","display":false}],"bytes":1819,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits|Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Small Colimits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]"},{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits|Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Small Colimits]]"},{"id":"3d83677380a58c7f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 III.7 Corollary 7，印刷144–145页、DjVu图78。$R_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 的前合成封闭性直接来自箭头复合；$q_{\\boldsymbol f}$ 的自然性来自结合律。若该筛覆盖 $C$，对 $u:D\\to C$ 拉回得到覆盖筛 $u^*R_{\\boldsymbol f}$。其每个 $g:E\\to D$ 有 $ug=f_i h$，于是 $(i,h)\\in P(E)$ 是 $u$ 的局部原像，故 $q$ 局部满。反向将局部满性用于 $\\operatorname{id}_C\\in y(C)(C)$，所得覆盖筛包含于 $R_{\\boldsymbol f}$；覆盖上闭性推出所需覆盖。[[14-thm-sheafification-epimorphism]]给第二个等价，[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]的层化左伴随保余积给末式。"}],"outgoing":["dad26c5de724390a","300365f146cacc8a","e21364f5dcced9e7","5036bba7ca747e71","28211adc1b0ce5bc","fd713aec6d1a8dd1","55bd5d1a324171ab","1f1269584b34ad4b"]}